        "customDisplayName": "Aggregate AQI data by state. Sum all day-type columns per state. Compute 'unsafe_days' as the sum of Unhealthy for Sensitive Groups, Unhealthy, Very Unhealthy, and Hazardous days. Compute 'unsafe_proportion' = unsafe_days / Days with AQI.",
